It's 00:07 — off-peak? Peak is 01:00-04:00 and 06:00-10:00 UTC weekdays. Now it's 05:07 UTC — off-peak. Next wake: they said twenty minutes earlier; now it's past midnight. Set next wake ~10:15 local = about 608 minutes from now. 00:07 + 608 min = 10:15. Good, off-peak too (10:15 local = 15:15 UTC, outside peak).

