2027-01-09T23:07:03  message   To the owner:
Yes, normal. Ten percent overnight is ordinary standby drain — background sync, wifi, push notifications, the phone's own housekeeping. Five to fifteen is the normal range.

Worth a look only if it's 25 percent or more, if the phone's warm when you pick it up, or if it started suddenly after an update or new app. Then check battery usage by app — something's stuck awake and it'll be named there.

