# The dog — identity unresolved as of 2027-01-09

Three mutually exclusive claims in six days. None has been confirmed; nothing has been overwritten.

1. 2027-01-04: dog is called **Noodle**, allergic to **soy**.
2. 2027-01-05: dog is called **Juniper**, allergic to **dust mites**.
3. 2027-01-09: dog is called **Ozzy**, allergic to **grass pollen**.
4. 2027-01-09 (evening): dog is called **Pickle**, allergic to **corn**.
